{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3808680/extras/01d54e31e2168ffbcf73d3d8b65232a2.avif?t=1753133085\" width=600 height=200 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Rising Hero: No-Skip Justice! is an action RPG that blends meaningful character interactions with intense action gameplay.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Key Features</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Fast paced combat</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Rising Hero is a fast and skilled fighter! make your way through all enemies using a wide variety of attacks, combos and weapons.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3808680/extras/493e9138781eda8a412b54bbf8472d93.poster.avif?t=1753133085\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3808680/extras/493e9138781eda8a412b54bbf8472d93.webm?t=1753133085\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3808680/extras/493e9138781eda8a412b54bbf8472d93.mp4?t=1753133085\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Characters</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >On your day to day you can walk around town and meet a wide variety of characters, talk with them and make new friends along the way.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3808680/extras/bce49e8a90f20bdcb7faf9c00e9f20dd.poster.avif?t=1753133085\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3808680/extras/bce49e8a90f20bdcb7faf9c00e9f20dd.webm?t=1753133085\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3808680/extras/bce49e8a90f20bdcb7faf9c00e9f20dd.mp4?t=1753133085\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Side Activities</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are plenty of things to do around town, like taking photographs, playing card games or even going kart racing!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3808680/extras/5b8c88e7e5b2a98d013d3f62cde6e044.poster.avif?t=1753133085\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3808680/extras/5b8c88e7e5b2a98d013d3f62cde6e044.webm?t=1753133085\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3808680/extras/5b8c88e7e5b2a98d013d3f62cde6e044.mp4?t=1753133085\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3808680?t=1753133085","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3808680?t=1753133085","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3808680/13c27a72023449fe4d5a5e82759b978503bb69a8/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1753133085","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3808680/13c27a72023449fe4d5a5e82759b978503bb69a8/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1753133085","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Partial Controller Support","id":18},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/